{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "93f510e58ddab6858d9a5cf4169a1f45795a8cbe9095b61bedfa594b30f67c81", "ja": "（39プロジェクトの公演まで、あと少し……。\nここさえ乗り切れば……）", "zh": "（到39PROJECT公演开始还有一点时间……\n只要能撑过现在……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_1001_p", "source_sha256": "c3a587fbc3cbacd59a7b72c0db68b4e0f0dd6da9d3d34112282f95a5c2f3aeaa", "ja": "……ダメだ。\n5分だけ、休憩しよう……。", "zh": "……不行了。\n休息个五分钟吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_1002_null", "source_sha256": "d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c", "ja": "数時間後……", "zh": "几小时后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d5bcd39577281dc9013a4f4d24c02102832c7dab9225d23d6e61c1ca451ceb96", "ja": "……はっ！\nい、今、何時だ！？", "zh": "……啊！\n现、现在几点了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_1004_008tak", "source_sha256": "a0d913446c635e3942d74e7463ca32606ae9b92814ed0529c4bb5235723e08df", "ja": "今は……夜の、7時になったところです。", "zh": "现在……刚过晚上七点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_1005_p", "source_sha256": "8b5a9a777c556f14f9ec3423df63d71fe9ac873c2a522b44d8065344a7e0f429", "ja": "夜の7時！？\nしまった、そんなに長く眠ってしまうとは……ん？", "zh": "晚上七点！？\n糟了，没想到会睡这么久……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f1140af4a0ec3e6063b97c93d95fe608a1679d57e2cbee22f07de8f2b1fac0d5", "ja": "肩に、ストールが……？\nこれはいったい……。", "zh": "我肩膀上有披肩……？\n这究竟是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_1007_008tak", "source_sha256": "fde21188f3f4dbf906e039ad92e2b59d2b132e6df1355f5935a423a3095ce6a3", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れのようですね。\n差し出がましいかと思いましたが、私が。", "zh": "{$P$}，看来你很累呢。\n虽然可能有点多管闲事，但小女子还是替你披上了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_1008_p", "source_sha256": "7eb684f00a4e13d52aebd5ac9ce434e8f20c721eff959833c496d4725d7d5a95", "ja": "貴音だったのか、ありがとう。\n心配かけちゃったな。", "zh": "原来是贵音帮我披的啊，谢谢你。\n害你担心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_1009_008tak", "source_sha256": "8c0723a80adc64a45180e2910f87e34abfd98f735b61254ef9d9f0c5f08e7009", "ja": "本日の予定は終了だと、美咲嬢に確認しました。\n今宵はどうぞ、ゆっくりとお休みください。", "zh": "小女子跟美咲小姐确认过，今天安排的事都完成了。\n今晚还请好好休息。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "864fcc35d5346df516e63cfcd48c4a5c985fa7b25e6b2ec9b828bfc6c07e2f7f", "ja": "本番まで、あと少し。今、{$P$}が\n倒れてしまっては、それこそ一大事……。", "zh": "到正式上场前还有一点时间。要是现在\n{$P$}倒下了，那才是大问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_1011_p", "source_sha256": "ec49a61191a4c435a53728a0468cfb875628320951f66eacfb2b779d97432593", "ja": "そうだな、気をつけるよ……。\n初公演間近だけど、新人達の様子はどうだった？", "zh": "也对，我会注意的……\n首次公演就快到了，新人她们状况如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_1012_008tak", "source_sha256": "89d3ae73ed5a13f54e832ffc7d37150df2c9ab20f4b3a1fd817d78c0e25d0970", "ja": "皆、つつがなく。とはいえ、\nさすがに緊張を隠せない者も何人か……。", "zh": "大家都安然无恙。话虽如此，\n还是有几个人隐藏不住紧张之情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "9cdbbb27186581f28f3d08f0240db7049f96bd3d681dcdfc00110ce9a696b0da", "ja": "今はただ、皆の成功を願ってやみません。\n本番に向けた努力が、最高の形で実を結ぶようにと…。", "zh": "现在只能不断祈祷大家成功。希望她们为了\n正式上场所做的努力，能以最棒的方式开花结果……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_1014_p", "source_sha256": "c07dfc350d5e0ac8b9d5eda4674ba8fbef7180561a74a4634026952e53ccbb5e", "ja": "そうだな。でも、あの子達なら大丈夫だろう。\n頼りになる先輩達もいるし。", "zh": "就是说啊。但我想那群孩子们应该没问题，\n毕竟她们还有可靠的前辈在啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_1015_008tak", "source_sha256": "7cf1c75a438069d8ad6ed4f7a82d17a6db818d19274f138a7030c702d70e0ea2", "ja": "はい。当日は万全の態勢で皆をさぽーとする\nつもりでいます。ですが……。", "zh": "是的，当天小女子打算以万全的架势\n去支援大家，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f49743c806e6a9f9b7118b0f46712c4d2f957a8fe4298743a56c0261e914fcb0", "ja": "なにか、問題でも？", "zh": "有什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_1017_008tak", "source_sha256": "91ba8dbd5c0dabcae53d45a18a9d5701d14e3fd4760890f8a74d8b809a1cdd9e", "ja": "私は、何かを見落としているような……。\n本番を前にしているというのに、もどかしく……。", "zh": "感觉小女子似乎遗漏了某些事……\n明明就快正式上场了，让人实在焦急……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_1018_008tak", "source_sha256": "b3aa8b052bdce29d6a7d9eb28e17cf7a04b6d14e4a661079736862397ba2b973", "ja": "{$P$}。\n何か、思い当たることはないでしょうか？", "zh": "{$P$}，\n你想得出来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_1019_p", "source_sha256": "4d1b2fd1c675fcccadf11833f93e1429c028a5956849fd323c0d4be86ed11ecd", "ja": "うーん。もしかしたら……。", "zh": "嗯～该不会是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_1020", "source_sha256": "2f6ca24ecad8ae50ef5dab158c57e6520d2d3d854c4dff28c1d4bcfe5e162a6d", "ja": "貴音のこと", "zh": "贵音本身", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_2000_p", "source_sha256": "1876ead78507f4094d1fb3ce1e752178fd5c866a6a9d6f46fd2a64fdea06b9dc", "ja": "貴音自身のことじゃないか？", "zh": "会是贵音你本身吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_2001_008tak", "source_sha256": "5ed01c521a5b2ae014891016f722ba53308af582cbb2cefa0f34b182c8cd0f75", "ja": "私、自身の……？", "zh": "小女子、本身……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_2002_p", "source_sha256": "4d37497fe0df52ae212bd2822688eb6a98e04165f9c47a6faabf96735720b154", "ja": "貴音はここのところ、後輩の面倒を見るために、\nこうして遅くまで残ってくれていたからな。", "zh": "因为贵音最近为了照顾后辈，\n总是留到这么晚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_2003_p", "source_sha256": "03e03d590e24609ae2be011e709f3a68d37ebfc4d6a3544d890ac871c18e12b6", "ja": "他人に気を配りすぎて、\n自分のことをおろそかにしてないか？", "zh": "你是不是太关心他人，\n反而忽略了自己的状况？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_2004_008tak", "source_sha256": "3fdf518825d8de80a18510a48504154ae5e1a3c5f17643c3d9c9da43c35970de", "ja": "言われてみれば……確かに、そうかもしれません。", "zh": "这么说来……确实有这种可能。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_2005_008tak", "source_sha256": "a0496b9d0c0b15a37f0fa308f136bc957c1df79852341e7aa8e7d4cc14c840ac", "ja": "皆の日々の成長が嬉しく、その事ばかり気にかけて……\n私自身を省みることを、忘れておりました。", "zh": "因为看着大家日渐成长实在很开心，所以小女子\n一直在意着后辈们……而忘了要反省小女子本身。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_2006_008tak", "source_sha256": "c5d8e912813115a0796f8d16af8f2c4926c823751d5e1db3505dc0eacf704eae", "ja": "私はこれより、己が成すべきことに集中します。\n……ありがとうございます、{$P$}。", "zh": "今后小女子会专心做好份内之事……\n非常感谢，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_2007_p", "source_sha256": "0439adf4542c6d9a7e18ff4a9a2d278089a9c64def030f26a3c9e96d92f71f24", "ja": "お礼を言うのはこっちだよ。\n貴音がみんなを見守っててくれて、本当に助かった。", "zh": "该道谢的人是我。\n贵音愿意帮忙照看大家，真的帮了我大忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_2008_008tak", "source_sha256": "bce8eb6a69b263a9b811a9290d6532094aab134b818fcdb26c9dbf849ee79fb9", "ja": "いえ、お気になさらないでください。\n皆との関わりは、私自身の励みになっているのです。", "zh": "不，请别放在心上。\n和大家互动，对小女子来说也是一种激励。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_2009_008tak", "source_sha256": "48f9a03b93de1dae488dda922f8f47d33c5939e3a31f008955b7eb79b5f39c95", "ja": "私を慕い、頼りにしてくれる皆のために、\n成すべきことを成す……これもまた、私の使命かと。", "zh": "大家既然追随、依赖着小女子，\n小女子也会做好该做的事……这或许也是小女子的使命。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_2010_p", "source_sha256": "3c7b612d1cc6a72b7542e925bb500e8e2e3620a076f74f59e6ded70e71225d2a", "ja": "……そうか。\nそれじゃ、俺も自分の使命を果たさないとな。", "zh": "……这样啊。\n那么，我也得完成自己的使命呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_2011_008tak", "source_sha256": "d98c7a84f4fa066b7dd82b173a2ea43af1cbcf93814993fbae6865ed6a1fb4d1", "ja": "{$P$}の使命……ですか？", "zh": "{$P$}的使命……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_2012_p", "source_sha256": "fdae9a3660134e45f9e0529827173a7925f5ba09317ea734c1845829259fb1f1", "ja": "そう。俺の使命の一つは、\n貴音をアイドルとして、プロデュースすることだ。", "zh": "没错。我的使命就只有一个，\n那就是把贵音当成偶像好好培育。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_2013_008tak", "source_sha256": "9a66032a7ec6de75c022068fb77271711f9b07382f8c38baf2ab2b89af9bcbbd", "ja": "あ……っ。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_008tak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_008tak_003_2014_p", "source_sha256": "290274a664a1ffc89fc54b703ab2706c0d3f9a825e3494a3b2284a42973569ca", "ja": "俺達が目指す場所への道のりは、まだ遠い。\nこれからも一緒に頑張ろうな、貴音！", "zh": "现在离我们的目标还远着呢。\n以后也继续一起加油吧，贵音！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
